# Design System

## Tokens

- Source of truth: `src/assets/colors.css` CSS variables
- Map into Tailwind via `tailwind.config.js` (e.g. `bg-surface`, `text-text-muted`, `primary`)
- Prefer utilities + tokens over new one-off hex values

## Styling approach

- Follow V2: Tailwind utilities + shared `src/style.css`
- Do not port reference per-section CSS files from legacy `DTS-WEB`
- Dark mode: `dark` class on `<html>` via `useTheme` / `dts-theme` in localStorage

## Visual guidance (marketing surfaces)

- One clear composition per viewport; brand-forward hero
- Full-bleed hero when adding/changing landing heroes
- Avoid card clutter, floating badges on hero media, and purple-gradient AI defaults
- Preserve existing DTS visual identity and motion utilities (`.reveal`, fade-up, etc.)
